:32Z","updated_at":"2026-06-30T13:50:28Z","closed_at":"2026-06-30T13:50:28Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/af65d2d3-64d2-4306-bf43-a382a54c5376\n\n### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.7 beta4, 4.7 beta5, 4.7 stable (drags and scrolls at the same time)\n- Reproducible in 4.7 dev5, 4.7 beta1, 4.7 beta2, 4.7 beta3 (either drags or scrolls)\n- Not reproducible in 4.6.3 stable, 4.7 dev1, 4.7 dev2, 4.7 dev3, 4.7 dev4\n\nSeems like 4.7 dev5 is the first instance of this\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.stable - Freedesktop SDK 24.08 (Flatpak runtime) on Wayland - Wayland display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - AMD Radeon Graphics (radeonsi, renoir, ACO, DRM 3.64, 6.17.0-35-generic) - AMD Ryzen 7 5825U with Radeon Graphics (16 threads) - 30.69 GiB memory - PulseAudio (44100 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen I try to rearrange nodes in the Scene dock by dragging (I have drag bound to a trackpad double-tap, for maximum specificity), the editor attempts to both drag (in the mouse cursor sense) and scroll (in the touchscreen sense). I use Ubuntu on a Dell Inspiron 16 5625 which has a touch screen.\n\nIn order to see the bug, the nodes in the Scene dock must go past the size of the container so scrolling is possible.\n\nThe behavior I would expect is for only the node-placement-dragging action to occur, since I am using my trackpad and not the touchscreen.\n\nThere are two versions of the bug:\n4.7 dev5 to 4.7 beta3 -- the editor either drags or scrolls, but I'm not sure how it picks\n4.7 beta4 to 4.7 stable -- the editor tries to drag and scroll at the same time\n\nEditor settings `interface/touchscreen/enable_touch_optimizations` and `interface/touchscreen/enable_pan_and_scale_gestures` don't seem to have an effect on the bug.\n\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Be using a laptop with a touch screen, I assume\n2. Have a Scene dock with enough nodes to be scrollable\n3. Use the cursor to try and drag/rearrange nodes in the tree\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[node-dragging-test-mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/29396123/node-dragging-test-mrp.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120669/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120669/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}